# No Summary Documents

**Do NOT create summary documents unless explicitly requested.**

## What NOT to Create

- ❌ IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md
- ❌ SUMMARY.md
- ❌ *_SUMMARY.md files
- ❌ CHANGELOG.md (unless specifically asked)
- ❌ Post-implementation summaries
- ❌ Achievement/statistics documents

## What IS Okay

- ✅ Technical documentation (guides, API docs)
- ✅ README.md files for new modules/features
- ✅ Architecture documentation
- ✅ Usage examples and tutorials
- ✅ Quick reference cards

## Rule

After completing a task, **respond with results only**. Do not create summary documents to recap what was done unless the user specifically requests a summary.

If user says "don't create summaries" or similar, remember this preference and never create them.
